{"t": "2026-10-14T14:12:46", "stage": "C3", "verb": "log", "args": ["Move (relating or contrasting), abductive, prompted by O'Mahony and Ferraro (2007): F-006 (decided order is rare) superseded by a bounded line, and a C01 history line written (abductive, prompted_by). Decided order gathers in rooms placed on a colour-faction theme or on vetting guests' requests: 7 of 39 (0.179) against 39 of 666 (0.059); held to size 7 against a null mean of 2.7 (p95 5, p 0.014); the gap is in the two smaller size quartiles (5 of 14 against 13 of 339) and vanishes in the two larger (2 of 25 against 26 of 327); 0 of 56 rooms that asked a host for space. The disagreement is about the setting (73 hours and one picture against 13 years and one code base) and bounds the claim. findings.jsonl 21 lines, history.jsonl 83. Snapped C3-move-relating-48. Also seen, not acted on: PurplePixels c0165 calls a member 'a fellow comrade during the button', a tie from an earlier event, which bears on the colour-faction boundary."], "opts": {"kind": "move"}, "offset": 0, "limit": 80, "lines": 1, "total": 1, "refused": null}
